{
  "title": "Vector Database Performance",
  "description": "Comprehensive monitoring of VibeCode vector database operations and performance metrics",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Database Overview",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Database Status",
              "type": "check_status",
              "check": "postgres.can_connect",
              "grouping": "cluster",
              "tags": ["service:vector-db"]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Total Vector Queries",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [{
                "q": "sum:vector_db.search.count{$env}.as_rate()",
                "aggregator": "avg",
                "conditional_formats": [
                  {
                    "comparator": ">",
                    "value": 500,
                    "palette": "white_on_red"
                  },
                  {
                    "comparator": ">=",
                    "value": 200,
                    "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                  },
                  {
                    "comparator": "<",
                    "value": 200,
                    "palette": "white_on_green"
                  }
                ]
              }],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Database Uptime",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [{
                "q": "avg:postgres.uptime{$env,service:vector-db}",
                "aggregator": "max",
                "conditional_formats": [
                  {
                    "comparator": "<",
                    "value": 3600,
                    "palette": "white_on_red"
                  },
                  {
                    "comparator": "<",
                    "value": 86400,
                    "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                  },
                  {
                    "comparator": ">=",
                    "value": 86400,
                    "palette": "white_on_green"
                  }
                ]
              }],
              "custom_unit": "seconds"
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Active Connections",
              "type": "timeseries",
              "requests": [{
                "q": "avg:postgres.connections{$env,service:vector-db} by {state}",
                "display_type": "area"
              }],
              "yaxis": {
                "scale": "linear",
                "include_zero": true,
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Vector Search Performance",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Vector Search Latency",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:vector_db.search.duration.avg{$env} by {collection}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:vector_db.search.duration.p95{$env} by {collection}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Latency (ms)",
                "scale": "log",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": false
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 200",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "Warning Threshold"
                },
                {
                  "value": "y = 500",
                  "display_type": "error dashed",
                  "label": "Critical Threshold"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "toplist",
              "title": "Slowest Vector Collections",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "top(avg:vector_db.search.duration.p95{$env} by {collection}, 10, 'mean', 'desc')",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 500,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">=",
                      "value": 200,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 200,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "heatmap",
              "title": "Vector Search Latency Distribution",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "vector_db.search.duration{$env}"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Latency (ms)",
                "scale": "sqrt",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": false
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Embedding Generation",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Embedding Generation Rate",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:vector_db.embedding.generation.count{$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "line"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Embeddings / sec",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Embedding Generation Latency",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:vector_db.embedding.generation.duration.avg{$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:vector_db.embedding.generation.duration.p95{$env}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Latency (ms)",
                "scale": "log",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Embedding Generation Errors",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:vector_db.embedding.generation.errors{$env}.as_count()",
                  "display_type": "bars"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Error Count",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Connection Pool Metrics",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Connection Pool Utilization",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:vector_db.pool.used{$env} by {pool_name} / avg:vector_db.pool.size{$env} by {pool_name} * 100",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Utilization %",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "include_zero": true
              },
              "markers": [
                {
                  "value": "y = 80",
                  "display_type": "warning dashed",
                  "label": "Warning Threshold"
                },
                {
                  "value": "y = 90",
                  "display_type": "error dashed",
                  "label": "Critical Threshold"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Connection Acquire Time",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:vector_db.pool.acquire_time.avg{$env} by {pool_name}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "q": "avg:vector_db.pool.acquire_time.p95{$env} by {pool_name}",
                  "display_type": "line",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "dashed",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Time (ms)",
                "scale": "log",
                "min": "auto",
                "max": "auto",
                "include_zero": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Connection Errors",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:vector_db.pool.errors{$env} by {error_type}.as_count()",
                  "display_type": "bars"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Error Count",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Cache Performance",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Cache Hit Ratio",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:vector_db.cache.hits{$env}.as_count() / (sum:vector_db.cache.hits{$env}.as_count() + sum:vector_db.cache.misses{$env}.as_count()) * 100",
                  "display_type": "line"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Hit Ratio %",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Cache Operations",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:vector_db.cache.gets{$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "cool",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "name": "Gets"
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:vector_db.cache.sets{$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "name": "Sets"
                },
                {
                  "q": "sum:vector_db.cache.invalidations{$env}.as_rate()",
                  "display_type": "area",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "grey",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "name": "Invalidations"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Operations / sec",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Cache Size",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "sum:vector_db.cache.size_bytes{$env}",
                  "display_type": "line"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Size (bytes)",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "Database Resources",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Database CPU Usage",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:kubernetes.cpu.usage.total{$env,pod_name:vector-db-*,container_name:postgres}",
                  "display_type": "line"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "CPU Usage",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Database Memory Usage",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:kubernetes.memory.usage{$env,pod_name:vector-db-*,container_name:postgres}",
                  "display_type": "line"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Memory Usage",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Database Disk Usage",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "q": "avg:kubernetes.volume.usage{$env,pod_name:vector-db-*} by {persistentvolumeclaim}",
                  "display_type": "line"
                }
              ],
              "yaxis": {
                "label": "Disk Usage",
                "scale": "linear",
                "min": 0,
                "include_zero": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Vector Database Monitoring\n\nThis dashboard provides comprehensive monitoring of the vector database performance metrics. Key metrics to watch:\n\n- **Vector Search Latency**: Should stay below 200ms for optimal user experience\n- **Embedding Generation Rate**: High rates may indicate potential token usage concerns\n- **Connection Pool Utilization**: Approaching 100% indicates need for pool expansion\n- **Cache Hit Ratio**: Low hit ratio may indicate inefficient caching strategy\n- **Resource Utilization**: Monitor for scaling needs\n\nFor detailed metrics explanation and alerting thresholds, see the [Vector DB Operations Guide](https://docs.vibecode.dev/vector-db-ops).",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": true,
        "tick_pos": "bottom",
        "tick_edge": "left"
      }
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "default": "production",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [
        "production",
        "staging",
        "development"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "is_read_only": false,
  "notify_list": []
}